    "name_raw": "Spider Step",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Advanced Player’s Guide",
    "definition_raw": "Your physical mastery grants you an impossible stride.\n\nPrerequisites: Acrobatics 6 ranks, Climb 6 ranks, monk level 6th.\n\nBenefit: As a move action, you can move up to half your slow fall distance (maximum 50 feet) across a wall or ceiling or across ropes, branches, or even water or other surfaces that cannot support your weight. You must reach a solid, level surface by the end of your turn or you will fall.",
